me":"和光市","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid","resource_code":"903"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[139.62242126464844,35.78147888183594]}}],"display_comment_original":"和光市周辺には、近世村の記憶として下新倉村、上新倉村などの旧村名が見える。 この地域には史跡や遺跡、古墳や貝塚、寺社や信仰の場に関わる場所が見え、午王山遺跡、四反歩遺跡、吹上貝塚のような地点が探索の入口になる。 現地では史跡説明板、下新倉村、上新倉村ゆかりの旧境石標や村の歴史案内板を、既存ピンと照らして歩くと発見しやすい。","story_enrichment":{"samurai_priority_people":[],"notable_people":["大石真","清水かつら"],"honorary_citizens":[],"tourism_landmarks":[],"specialties":[],"food_culture":[],"historical_domains":[],"heian_place_names":[],"japan_search_support":[],"enrichment_sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%92%8C%E5%85%89%E5%B8%82","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11438241","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11560710"],"enrichment_errors":[],"wikipedia_title":"和光市","wikipedia_revision_id":"110629557","wikidata_qid":"Q658058","wikipedia_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%92%8C%E5%85%89%E5%B8%82","japan_search_query_url":"","status":"wikipedia_ok"}}